{"seq":4,"slug":"operations","title":"生产运维","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/event-driven-architecture/operations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"asyncapi-contract-governance","title":"AsyncAPI 契约治理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/event-driven-architecture/operations/asyncapi-contract-governance","wordCount":1134,"readingTime":5},{"seq":2,"slug":"event-mesh-routing","title":"Event Mesh 与事件路由","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/event-driven-architecture/operations/event-mesh-routing","wordCount":1365,"readingTime":6},{"seq":3,"slug":"observability-dlq-resilience","title":"可观测性与容错运维","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/event-driven-architecture/operations/observability-dlq-resilience","wordCount":1634,"readingTime":7}],"introMarkdown":"# 生产运维\n\n本章从「写代码」转向「跑系统」。AsyncAPI 契约治理让事件接口像 REST API 一样可文档化、可版本管理；Event Mesh 把点对点的 Broker 连接升级为企业级的事件路由网络；DLQ、重试策略与 EDA 特有的可观测性则是保障系统在生产环境中持续健康运行的最后防线。\n\n推荐在完成前三章的学习后再进入本章——此时你已具备足够的概念储备来理解这些运维实践背后的设计动机。\n"}